00:46:11.485 --> 00:46:15.305
Gilead, GenenTech,

00:46:15.305 --> 00:46:18.550
these pharmaceutical companies often have epidemiologists

00:46:18.550 --> 00:46:20.985
who are on their teams.

00:46:20.985 --> 00:46:25.780
And often what the epidemiologists have to do is to actually see what's out there,

00:46:25.780 --> 00:46:29.620
what's been published, what's the disease burden,

00:46:29.620 --> 00:46:32.270
and they have to actually do a systematic review of

00:46:32.270 --> 00:46:35.540
the existing evidence and these skills will help you,

00:46:35.540 --> 00:46:38.465
add to the kinds of things that you couldn't

00:46:38.465 --> 00:46:41.220
do in these roles.

00:46:41.220 --> 00:46:43.320
Yeah. I will just add that

