I think the skills that we teach are largely foundational skills.

00:46:46.350 --> 00:46:49.245
I mean, they're in a particular area about medicine but

00:46:49.245 --> 00:46:52.070
data science is a huge field right now.

00:46:52.070 --> 00:46:54.065
Being able to analyze data in ourselves and

00:46:54.065 --> 00:46:57.400
understanding the implications of where the data come from,

00:46:57.400 --> 00:46:59.360
that's a transferable skill

00:46:59.360 --> 00:47:01.160
across a lot of fields right now.

00:47:01.160 --> 00:47:04.430
Right. And if I may add Dr. Sainani just reminded me.

