00:47:16.430 --> 00:47:20.420
learning about the methodology and how to actually approach the data analysis,

00:47:20.420 --> 00:47:25.340
what we constantly tell our students is that the statistical program is

00:47:25.340 --> 00:47:30.545
just a tool and we don't want people just using that- using it as a black box.

00:47:30.545 --> 00:47:34.100
So, how to think about analyzing and thinking about

00:47:34.100 --> 00:47:38.610
the approach that's informed by what the methodology was and what the measurements are,

00:47:38.610 --> 00:47:40.830
are the skills that we do teach.

00:47:40.830 --> 00:47:42.910
Actually Dr. Sainani

00:47:42.910 --> 00:47:45.610
