00:47:45.610 --> 00:47:48.060
much know what she covers and she knows what I cover

00:47:48.060 --> 00:47:50.715
and it's a very nice complimentary

00:47:50.715 --> 00:47:53.550
sort of teaching sort of partnership.

00:47:53.550 --> 00:47:55.790
Yeah, great.

