00:50:06.675 --> 00:50:09.850
I put into the statistical method then I can understand the pluses and

00:50:09.850 --> 00:50:13.430
minuses of that method so that the particular methods to me in,

00:50:13.430 --> 00:50:15.950
in a way are less important than knowing how to assess

00:50:15.950 --> 00:50:19.940
